{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense investigative horror experience for solo players or up to 4-player co-op. Search for hidden clues, notes, and evidence in the darkness as you piece together the truth behind the spirit\u2019s death, including the killer, the time, the place, and the method. You may not be alone in the house. Something is watching, roaming, and learning. Find the clues and lock in your verdict before it finds you, and before the whispers break your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/423e8bbde3f0f374b5381de37e029e82.webp?t=1769759815\" width=1215 height=56 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer or Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Play alone or team up with up to three other players in online co-op to investigate haunted locations together. Choose when to stick close to steady your nerves or split up to cover more ground, knowing isolation comes with risks.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/61b5b7cffc761ca94a0988687385d84f.poster.avif?t=1769759815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/61b5b7cffc761ca94a0988687385d84f.webm?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/61b5b7cffc761ca94a0988687385d84f.mp4?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Voice Chat:</strong> Communicate with teammates in real time using built-in voice chat. Clear coordination helps solve puzzles faster, react to threats, and maintain sanity during tense moments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/c3f40f063eb3f3d69323a11b53c1bec4.webp?t=1769759815\" width=1215 height=56 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Investigations:</strong> Explore detailed, atmospheric environments and search for hard evidence by interacting with objects, unlocking drawers, and carefully observing your surroundings. The environment tells a story if you take the time to read it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/a63553450a49342d97d8c2a62197259a.poster.avif?t=1769759815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/a63553450a49342d97d8c2a62197259a.webm?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Note and Clue System:</strong> Notes, clues, and puzzles are procedurally placed each expedition, ensuring investigations feel fresh while maintaining narrative coherence. Information often only makes sense once all the pieces are brought together.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/cf91bd1c33a8df9c5213666f41f36700.poster.avif?t=1769759815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/cf91bd1c33a8df9c5213666f41f36700.webm?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/cf91bd1c33a8df9c5213666f41f36700.mp4?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Verdict:</strong> Assemble your findings into a final conclusion by identifying what happened, where it occurred, and how it unfolded. Players must review notes, compare evidence, and commit to a verdict before the investigation ends, knowing incomplete or incorrect conclusions carry consequences.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/36b03cd25f5f3aae9b473ba8cc444170.poster.avif?t=1769759815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/36b03cd25f5f3aae9b473ba8cc444170.webm?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/36b03cd25f5f3aae9b473ba8cc444170.mp4?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/908511f7205cd911b2a23c675802bd0f.webp?t=1769759815\" width=1215 height=56 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural Encounters:</strong> Face escalating paranormal phenomena that respond to your actions and growing instability. The deeper you investigate, the bolder and more dangerous the entity becomes..<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/a0c87f18b453bfd15d18a9854f3f8447.poster.avif?t=1769759815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/a0c87f18b453bfd15d18a9854f3f8447.webm?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death\u2019s Door Mechanic:</strong> When captured by a ghost, players enter a trance state where they can attempt to escape or pull another player in to take their place. These moments create intense strategic and moral decisions under pressure.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/e180304dff430b54b55bb394ae8186f4.poster.avif?t=1769759815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/e180304dff430b54b55bb394ae8186f4.webm?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Atmosphere:</strong> Haunting visuals, environmental storytelling, and immersive sound design work together to create constant tension, where footsteps, whispers, and flickering lights keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/0502ce8918626d18f04548d0913b6ef2.avif?t=1769759815\" width=1215 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains flashing lights, sudden audio, hallucination effects, and jumpscares. Player discretion advised. For the best experience use headphones at a safe volume.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340890?t=1769759815","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769759815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/3914552ea067f2a2f2629eaba56e039a75433337/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769759815","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/3914552ea067f2a2f2629eaba56e039a75433337/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769759815","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game includes depictions of blood, unsettling supernatural creatures, and flickering lights that may pose a seizure risk for sensitive individuals. Some evidence feature ropes in contexts that could suggest self-harm."},"demos":[{"appid":4142100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/f4fa39d5326f8d4001213470de725740.avif?t=1769759815\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras_big/f4fa39d5326f8d4001213470de725740.webp?t=1769759815 width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense investigative horror experience for solo players or up to 4-player co-op. Search for hidden clues, notes, and evidence in the darkness as you piece together the truth behind the spirit\u2019s death, including the killer, the time, the place, and the method. You may not be alone in the house. Something is watching, roaming, and learning. Find the clues and lock in your verdict before it finds you, and before the whispers break your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas