s. The environment tells a story if you take the time to read it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/a63553450a49342d97d8c2a62197259a.poster.avif?t=1769759815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/a63553450a49342d97d8c2a62197259a.webm?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Note and Clue System:</strong> Notes, clues, and puzzles are procedurally placed each expedition, ensuring investigations feel fresh while maintaining narrative coherence. Information often only makes sense once all the pieces are brought together.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/cf91bd1c33a8df9c5213666f41f36700.poster.avif?t=1769759815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/cf91bd1c33a8df9c5213666f41f36700.webm?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/cf91bd1c33a8df9c5213666f41f36700.mp4?t=1769759815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Verdict:</strong> Assemble your findings into a final conclusion by identifying what happened, where it occurred, and how it unfolded. Players must review notes, compare evidence, and commit to a verdict before the investigation ends, knowing incomplete or incorrect conclusions carry consequences.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/3